# Authored on Windows and macOS, served from a Linux container to a browser
# and compiled into a desktop binary. Pin LF everywhere so a checkout on any
# side is byte-identical -- the two consumers of packages/ui must get the same
# bytes.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
*.crt text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
